<title>USA: Westinghouse, Infinity set voting date.</title>
<headline>Westinghouse, Infinity set voting date.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westinghouse Electric Corp and Infinity Broadcasting Corp said Tuesday that they have scheduled a date to vote on the merger between the two companies.</p>
<p>In a release Tuesday, Westinghouse said the two companies chose December 10, 1996 in New York City for special meetings for their shareholders to vote on the merger of Westinghouse and Infinity.</p>
<p>The record date for determining those shareholders entitled to vote at the meetings is October 15, 1996, Westinghouse added.</p>
